# Personal data must never be committed.
# Rote keeps the profile in chrome.storage.local, not on disk, so normally there
# is nothing here to ignore. These patterns exist in case an export from the
# options page is saved into the repo by accident.
rote-profile*.json
rote-export*.json
profile.json
*.local.json
/exports/

# Gradient Reader keeps its settings in chrome.storage.local too. These cover an
# export from its options page being saved into the repo by accident.
gradient-reader-settings*.json

# Tool leftovers
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
